Hello Principal Fredette,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I hope the new year is treating both you and your student body well.&nbsp; This weather has not been cooperating so far.&nbsp; Here at the Red Cross we are feeling that frustration as well with the storms that came through the East Coast and here in New England we lost the opportunity to collect over 5500 units of life saving blood.&nbsp; The way we are going to make that up is with new sponsors, like potentially yourself and your school.&nbsp; We are booking drives into April-June and would be meeting and putting plans together now for those drives.&nbsp; I look forward to the opportunity of speaking with you.<br />
<br />
Best Regards,<br />
